flowchart TD
    AUTH[Authorized session] --> SNAP[Snapshot plus compatible cursor]
    SNAP --> STREAM[Bounded authenticated stream]
    STREAM --> CHECK{Identity and ordering valid?}
    CHECK -->|Contiguous| APPLY[Apply display projection]
    APPLY --> STREAM
    CHECK -->|Exact duplicate in retained window| STREAM
    CHECK -->|Gap, overflow or expired cursor| RESET[Disable unsafe controls and resnapshot]
    RESET --> SNAP
    CHECK -->|Conflicting duplicate or foreign binding| FAIL[Reject and surface protocol error]
    STREAM -->|Session revoked| STOP[Close and clear sensitive view]
